WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.440
Publish raw pipeline results
before AI interpretation.

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:08.320
The proposed Azure pipeline publishes
failures explicitly and treats

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:12.880
missing results as a problem. It preserves
the runner's original exit status.

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:15.760
The AI adapter reads retained results,

00:00:15.816 --> 00:00:20.240
manifests and logs, then produces
a diagnosis with evidence links.

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:23.680
It cannot change test
status or approve a release.

00:00:23.827 --> 00:00:26.800
Check required-suite
completeness separately,

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:30.240
and remember that cancellation
can still interrupt evidence collection.
